          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h3>“To say the iRest Level 1 Training is a meditation teacher training, for me, simply doesn’t do it justice.  I’ve seen over and over again how iRest has completely transformed people’s lives - mine included.  It gave me an absolute perspective shift, a reset, and transformed the way I relate to myself, to life, and to everyone around me”</h3><p><em><strong>Una Hubbard, BA - Certified Yoga Teacher, Certified iRest Teacher</strong></em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
