            "text": "<h3>“From my first class to the ongoing trainings, the gentle, embracing teachings provided me with the tools to embark on my own fulfilling meditation practice.  Once I felt the power of the practice for myself, all I wanted to do was share it with others. I’ve chosen to work with U.S. veterans, which has been one of my most rewarding experiences”<br/>Mary S - Certified iRest Meditation Teacher</h3>"
