    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is iRest Yoga Nidra Meditation?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>iRest is a meditation practice based on the ancient tradition of Yoga Nidra and adapted to suit the conditions of modern life. When practiced regularly, iRest can enable you to meet each moment of your life with a feeling of unshakable peace and well-being, no matter how challenging or difficult your situation.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do I practice iRest Yoga Nidra Meditation?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>iRest offers practices for everyone, whether you are a lifelong meditator or have never tried meditation before. The practice of iRest starts as a guided meditation but over time iRest teaches you how to skillfully use tools that help you meet each moment of your life with unshakable peace of mind—on and off your meditation cushion. To try iRest you don't need to do anything complicated. Just take a moment to find a comfortable position—either seated or lying down. You can listen to the meditation with your eyes open or gently closed.\n</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the recommended and required reading for this training?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Required reading: the first chapter of your manual and Yoga Nidra: A Meditative Practice for Deep Relaxation and Healing by iRest Founder Richard Miller. Recommended reading: The iRest Program for Healing PTSD: A Proven-Effective Approach to Using Yoga Nidra Meditation and Deep Relaxation Techniques to Overcome Trauma by Richard Miller.\n</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Are there any prerequisites for this training?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>There are no prerequisites for this training. It is designed for all levels, whether you have experience with iRest, yoga, and meditation or not.\n</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "64c54989-1338-47b7-bd63-ddfa422511b7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Do I need to be a yoga teacher to take this training?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>No! This training was designed for everyone. It’s suited for those looking to start or enhance their personal meditation practice and those looking to include a new offering in their professional work. Beyond yoga environments, iRest is used in physical therapy, massage therapy, social work, clinical, and medical establishments; alternative or integrative medical practices; and in-job training and job resiliency programs.\n</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "19434ac0-1bc8-4fa7-9407-033dd509cb20": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Will I be a certified iRest teacher after taking this training?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Completion of this Level 1 Training does not make you a Certified iRest Teacher. Becoming fully certified is a separate, comprehensive process which includes attending an in-person Level 2 Training. More information about the next steps will be included with your course material content. iRest Level 1 teachers can begin delivering iRest Yoga Nidra Meditation in public and professional settings and use the title iRest Level 1 Teacher in advertising, promotional materials, and official channels. You’ll also be listed on the iRest website as an iRest Level 1 Teacher and can post your personal profile there, allowing people who are seeking iRest group or individual sessions to find you as a qualified provider.</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "195adf6e-7d69-4458-9adb-eaa295bb77f4": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "I’ve already completed the iRest Level 1 Training in person; should I take this course?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes! iRest strongly encourages that all current iRest Level 1 Teachers retake the training online to get a refresher on the teachings, practice, and delivery of iRest. Plus, with the online training, you’ll have lifetime access to course content.\n</p>",
            "background_color": "#7e4592",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
